      "q": 0.9706882183367764,
      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 7,
      "text": "Step 7: We see that there is no consistent value of \\( a \\) that satisfies all these conditions simultaneously. This implies that the only possible values for \\( a \\) are those that make the polynomial structure consistent, which leads us to check specific values.",
      "z": 3.5000157836112953
    },
