      "step_number": 8,
      "text": "Step 8: If \\( a = 0 \\), then from \\( b = -c^2 \\), substituting back, we get:\n\\[ c^2 - 2 \\text{ is also a root, so } (c^2 - 2)^2 = c^4 - 4c^2 + 4 = 0. \\]\nThis simplifies to \\( c^2 = 2 \\), giving \\( c = \\pm \\sqrt{2} \\).",
